amily:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">. SNS(</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">페이스북</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">인스타그램</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">유튜브 등</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">사용에 능숙한 </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">목포시민 및 전남도민</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">  </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">.</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">목포에 관심과 애정</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">을 가지고 다양한 소식을 직접 취재</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">·</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">홍보할 수 있는 자</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">  </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">매월 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">회 이상</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">꾸준히 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">SNS </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">원고</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">콘텐츠 및 영상 제출이 가능한 자</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">  </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">라</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">본인의 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">SNS(</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">페이스북</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">인스타그램</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">블로그</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">유튜브</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">를 운영 중인</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\">자</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-size:12.0pt;\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-fami